sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin
    actor P as Participants
    participant Web as Cloud Run web/control
    participant Sec as reCAPTCHA + Secret Manager + KMS
    participant DB as Firestore rolecall-dev
    participant Q as Pub/Sub / async jobs
    participant Store as Cloud Storage
    participant Runtime as Runtime job + GKE
    participant LK as LiveKit
    participant Agent as ADK voice worker
    participant AI as Vertex AI Gemini
    Admin->>Web: Login with CAPTCHA
    Web->>Sec: Verify risk and credential version
    Web->>DB: Throttle and create 8-hour session
    opt Runtime is sleeping
      Admin->>Web: Wake voice services
      Web->>Runtime: Start idempotent wake job
      Runtime->>LK: Restore nodes, 9 pods, TLS and media
      Runtime->>DB: Mark READY
    end
    Admin->>Web: Create room
    Web->>Sec: KMS-encrypt seat links
    opt Add context
      Admin->>Web: Upload document
      Web->>Store: Save immutable original
      Web->>Q: Index event
      Q->>AI: Generate 768D embeddings
      Q->>DB: Save sanitized vectors and citations
    end
    loop Each participant
      P->>Web: Exchange fragment seat capability
      Web->>DB: Verify digest and create/join occurrence
      Web-->>P: LiveKit JWT when runtime READY
      P->>LK: Join audio room
    end
    LK->>Agent: Dispatch facilitator
    Agent->>AI: Resumable Gemini Live session
    loop Controlled floor turns
      Agent->>LK: Grant mic only to floor owner
      P->>Agent: Speaker audio / hand raise
      opt Relevant document context
        AI->>Agent: search_room_docs(query)
        Agent->>DB: Room + frozen-version vector search
      end
      AI-->>Agent: Native audio and final caption
      Agent-->>P: Voice, captions and citation chips
      Agent->>DB: Final text/outcomes/citations only
    end
    Agent-->>P: Spoken closing recap
    Agent->>Q: Post-process
    Q->>AI: Typed summary
    Q->>DB: Recap + memory and mark COMPLETED
    Note over Web,Runtime: 30 idle minutes triggers guarded suspension to zero voice nodes/pods.
